### Test PREPARE Phase ###

## 1. Prepare DEBIT - Success
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-TEST-001-DEBIT",
    "account_id": "ACC001",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 100000.00
}

###

## 2. Prepare CREDIT - Success
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-TEST-001-CREDIT",
    "account_id": "ACC002",
    "operation": "CREDIT",
    "amount": 100000.00
}

###

## 3. Prepare DEBIT - Account Not Found
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-TEST-002-DEBIT",
    "account_id": "ACC999",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 50000.00
}

###

## 4. Prepare DEBIT - Insufficient Balance
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-TEST-003-DEBIT",
    "account_id": "ACC002",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 999999999.00
}

###

## 5. Prepare DEBIT - Account Already Locked
# (Run after test 1 without committing/rolling back)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-TEST-004-DEBIT",
    "account_id": "ACC001",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 50000.00
}

###

## 6. Prepare DEBIT - Idempotent (same TX again)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_id": "TX-TEST-001-DEBIT",
    "account_id": "ACC001",
    "operation": "DEBIT",
    "amount": 100000.00
}

###

## 7. Check accounts after prepare
GET http://localhost:8001/api/accounts

###

## 8. Check transactions after prepare
GET http://localhost:8001/api/transactions?status_filter=PREPARED
